      "instance_name": "woman_with_bruised_eye",
      "label": "woman with bruised eye",
      "description": "A woman with visible bruising under her left eye, appearing distressed or defeated, holding her chin with her hand. Her expression is somber and weary, suggesting she has endured physical harm. This is the lower half of the image, visually anchoring the meme's theme of domestic abuse.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
